"utc": "2020-12-11T00:00:00Z",
"body": "A new Crimson Desert trailer featuring actual gameplay has been revealed at The Game Awards 2020.\nIn addition to our new gameplay trailer reveal, we have also updated the official Crimson Desert website with brand new screenshots, and unique tales from the world of Crimson Desert. Be sure to check it out and don’t forget to subscribe!\nBe the first to hear about exciting new updates through the official Crimson Desert social media links below!\n\n### ● Join us on:\n\n» YouTube: [https://youtube.com/crimsondesert](https://www.youtube.com/crimsondesert)\n» Twitter: [https://twitter.com/crimsondesert_](https://www.twitter.com/crimsondesert_)\n» Discord: [https://discord.gg/crimsondesert](https://discord.gg/crimsondesert)\n» Facebook: [https://facebook.com/crimsondesert](https://www.facebook.com/crimsondesert)\n» Instagram: [https://instagram.com/crimsondesert_](https://instagram.com/crimsondesert_)"
