"title": "Crimson Desert Animated Symbol Reveal & Gameplay Trailer Announcement",
"utc": "2020-12-02T00:00:00Z",
"body": "The team at Pearl Abyss is happy to share an all-new animated symbol for Crimson Desert!\n\n### A saga written in blood in an age of fading legends...\n\n### A story of survival unfolds across the vast continent of Pywel.\n\n### The world of Pywel is ready to embrace fate.\n\n### Will yours be the one that defines it?\n\nFor all of you out there who are hungry for more than our animated symbol, we invite you to join us for the premiere of our Crimson Desert gameplay trailer scheduled to take place during The Game Awards 2020, which will be broadcast live across the world on Dec. 10 at 15:30 (PST).\n\n### ■ Watch “The Game Awards 2020” Live: [ Link ]\n\n### ■ Official Crimson Desert YouTube Channel: [ Link ]\n\nThe all-new gameplay trailer revealed during the event will also be available on our official Crimson Desert YouTube channel.\nWe look forward to your continued support for our developing title. Thank you!"
